      "title": "ITS: enable decoding of UDP datagram as ITS message",
      "message": "ITS: enable decoding of UDP datagram as ITS message\n\nBy default, ITS messages are send based on the geonetworking protocol.\nSeveral tools send these messages via UDP as well\nThis patch enables \"Decode As ITS\" for UDP packets\n",
      "author_name": "Igor Passchier",
      "author_email": "igor.passchier@tassinternational.com",
      "authored_date": "2020-08-29T21:53:48.000+02:00",
